From f0d0d0ac1c187707f48fcf2cb03cb1551783efc7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AURA Conversion Engine <aura@example.invalid>
Date: Tue, 16 Jun 2026 18:49:39 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 6/11] ASoC: codecs: lpass-va-macro: migrate runtime PM and clock sequencing

Replace the vendor lpass-cdc-clk-rsc clock voting framework with direct
upstream clock framework calls (clk_prepare_enable/clk_disable_unprepare),
a local fsgen helper, and standard runtime PM callbacks.

Clock resources are acquired via devm_clk_get in probe following the
upstream lpass-va-macro pattern. Runtime PM suspend/resume handle
regcache dirty/sync and power domain transitions.

Signed-off-by: AURA Conversion Engine <aura@example.invalid>
---
